          {
           "id": "521dc166",
           "settings": {
            "editor": "<p class=\"lead fade-up\">Your heating and cooling system works hard through East Tennessee&#8217;s humid summers and freezing winter cold snaps. Skipping routine care allows dust and wear to build up, leading to sudden breakdowns, higher energy bills, and a shorter equipment lifespan.</p>"
           },
           "elements": [],
           "isInner": true,
           "widgetType": "text-editor",
           "elType": "widget"
          },
          {
           "id": "521dd4bd",
           "settings": {
            "editor": "<p class=\"lead fade-up\">With the <strong>Bear Necessities Maintenance Plan</strong>, our local technicians handle the heavy lifting by inspecting, cleaning, and tuning your system twice a year so you can enjoy worry-free comfort.</p>"
           },
