           },
           "elements": [
            {
             "id": "521ed028",
             "settings": {
              "html": "<p class=\"eyebrow\"><svg class=\"paw\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-paw\"/></svg>Membership Advantages</p>"
             },
             "elements": [],
             "isInner": true,
             "widgetType": "html",
             "elType": "widget"
            },
            {
             "id": "521ee37f",
             "settings": {
              "title": "What&#8217;s Included in Your Membership?",
              "header_size": "h2",
              "typography_font_size": {
               "unit": "custom",
               "size": "clamp(1.75rem, 3vw, 2.45rem)",
               "sizes": []
              },
              "typography_font_size_tablet": {
               "unit": "custom",
               "size": "clamp(1.75rem, 3vw, 2.45rem)",
               "sizes": []
              },
              "typography_font_size_mobile": {
               "unit": "custom",
               "size": "clamp(1.75rem, 3vw, 2.45rem)",
               "sizes": []
              },
              "typography_typography": "custom"
             },
             "elements": [],
             "isInner": true,
             "widgetType": "heading",
             "elType": "widget"
            },
            {
             "id": "521ef6d6",
             "settings": {
              "editor": "<p>Joining our maintenance plan gives you more than routine tune-ups. You get priority care and complete peace of mind:</p><ul><li><strong>Two Seasonal Tune-Ups Per Year:</strong> One comprehensive heating inspection in the fall and one full cooling check in the spring.</li><li><strong>10% Discount on Repairs &amp; Priority Service:</strong> Save on qualifying parts and labor, plus jump to the front of the line when emergency service is needed.</li><li><strong>Deep System Cleaning:</strong> Includes condenser coil, condensate drain, and evaporator coil cleaning to prevent water leaks and keep your system running efficiently.</li><li><strong>Full Inspection &amp; Filter Service:</strong> We inspect electrical components, test safety controls, verify performance, and install fresh air filters (using customer-provided filters).</li><li><strong>Automated Seasonal Reminders:</strong> We track your schedule and remind you when it&#8217;s time for your bi-annual maintenance visits.</li></ul>"
             },
             "elements": [],
             "isInner": true,
             "widgetType": "text-editor",
             "elType": "widget"
            }
           ],
           "isInner": true,
           "elType": "container"
