            {
             "id": "521f4432",
             "settings": {
              "editor": "<ol class=\"steps-list\"><li><strong>Sign Up &amp; Lock In Savings</strong><p>Call our office or submit a quick request online to start your one-year membership.</p></li><li><strong>We Schedule Your Tune-Ups</strong><p>Our local office team reaches out every spring and fall to book your maintenance visits at a time that fits your busy schedule.</p></li><li><strong>Enjoy Worry-Free Comfort</strong><p>Sit back and relax knowing your system is running at peak performance, backed by 10% repair savings and priority service.</p></li></ol>"
