         "id": "52203f9d",
         "settings": {
          "html": "<div class=\"faq-list\"><details class=\"qa reveal\" style=\"--d:0\" open><summary>Does the $149 fee cover my entire home if I have two HVAC units?<span class=\"pm\"><svg class=\"icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-plus\"/></svg></span></summary><div class=\"ans\"><p><strong>No, the $149 fee covers your primary HVAC system for one full year.</strong> You can add each additional heating and cooling unit in your home to your plan for just <strong>$50 per year</strong>, which includes two complete maintenance visits for those secondary systems as well.</p></div></details><details class=\"qa reveal\" style=\"--d:1\"><summary>When are the two seasonal maintenance visits performed?<span class=\"pm\"><svg class=\"icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-plus\"/></svg></span></summary><div class=\"ans\"><p><strong>Maintenance visits are scheduled twice a year, once in the spring and once in the fall.</strong> Your spring visit preps your air conditioner or heat pump for summer heat, while your fall visit ensures your furnace or backup heating coils run safely before winter freezes arrive.</p></div></details><details class=\"qa reveal\" style=\"--d:2\"><summary>What if I need repairs during my maintenance visit?<span class=\"pm\"><svg class=\"icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-plus\"/></svg></span></summary><div class=\"ans\"><p><strong>If our technician finds worn parts or electrical issues, we will provide a clear, upfront estimate before doing any work.</strong> As a maintenance plan member, you automatically receive a <strong>10% discount on all qualifying repairs</strong>.</p></div></details><details class=\"qa reveal\" style=\"--d:3\"><summary>Do you supply the replacement air filters?<span class=\"pm\"><svg class=\"icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-plus\"/></svg></span></summary><div class=\"ans\"><p><strong>No, our technicians install customer-provided air filters during tune-up visits.</strong> If you have your preferred filter brand or media size ready when we arrive, our technician will inspect the air box, remove the old filter, and properly install the fresh replacement at no extra charge.</p></div></details></div>"
         },
         "elements": [],
         "isInner": true,
         "widgetType": "html",
         "elType": "widget"
        }
       ],
